5,1,1,talk,Minato,,I want to make sure we can actually finish the work on time. What should we look at first?,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,May,,"We need to be realistic about the money. It's not just the build, but the cost to keep it running.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Shizue,,I agree with May. I worry that beautiful drawings often hide things that fall apart far too quickly.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Victoria,,We also have to consider who will actually manage the site daily. Staffing is always a concern.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Shunichi,,Exactly. We can't ignore how people actually use the space and how the land handles the rain.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Minato,,"@Shunichi, do you think the ground is a problem? I'm worried about the diggers and the soil.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,May,,"@Victoria, if we find a plan that's too complex, will the city even have the staff to maintain it?","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Shizue,,I would like to see how the previous projects have held up over the last few years.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Victoria,,"That is a good point, Shizue. We need to match the plan to our actual manpower.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Shunichi,,I want to see the drainage records and how people cross the park on weekdays.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Minato,,I'll look into the firms doing the earth-moving and the depot notes on hoarding.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,May,,I'll check the upkeep ledger and the groundskeeping roll to see the real costs.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Shizue,,I will look at the condition of earlier works and the record of the eastern avenue planting.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Victoria,,I'll investigate the volunteer groups and the groundskeeping roll as well.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Shunichi,,I'll take the drainage callouts and the timed counts of weekday crossings.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
