35,2,1,talk,Minato,,The earth-moving firms are worried about clay and slippage. Big digs look risky here.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,May,,I found that planted areas cost triple to maintain compared to hard surfaces. That's a huge gap.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,Shizue,,The eastern avenue trees died quickly due to poor aftercare. We can't trust the planting contracts.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Victoria,,Our staff is down to seven people. We rely heavily on bought-in services for specialist care.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Shunichi,,"People are mostly using the park as a shortcut to the tram, sticking to firm ground.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Minato,,"@Shunichi, if people want firm ground, maybe we should avoid too much soft landscaping?","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,May,,"@Victoria, with only seven staff, a high-maintenance garden would be a financial disaster.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,Shizue,,"I noticed the old overflow basin is still fine, but the paved apron is already patched.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,Victoria,,"We do have volunteers for habitat work and sports, which might help us manage certain plans.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Shunichi,,The drainage is failing and the heat is rising. We need something that handles water better.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Minato,,The depot says we can't hoard the center or gate without closing the park.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,May,,"If the upkeep costs for greenery are that high, we should lean toward hard-surfaced options.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,Shizue,,"@May, but the paving I saw was poor quality. We need something that actually lasts.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,Victoria,,"If we go with a sports or habitat plan, the volunteers could fill the staffing gap.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Shunichi,,"A paved plaza might just get too hot, given the August readings I saw.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
