60,3,1,talk,Minato,,The Woodland Walk seems too risky with the clay soil and the hoarding restrictions.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
61,3,1,talk,May,,"The Market Plaza is the cheapest to maintain, but is it the most practical?","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
62,3,1,talk,Shizue,,"The Wetland Restoration seems most durable, as the old basin is still in great shape.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
63,3,1,talk,Victoria,,Sports Terraces would be great because we already have volunteers for the youth league.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
64,3,1,talk,Shunichi,,"The Wetland plan solves the drainage issues and the heat, unlike the Plaza.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
65,3,2,talk,Minato,,"@Shunichi, would the Wetland plan require too much heavy earth-moving?","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
66,3,2,talk,May,,"@Victoria, would the Sports Terraces be cheaper to maintain than a forest?","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
67,3,2,talk,Shizue,,I trust the water-based works more than the new plantings or the cheap paving.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
68,3,2,talk,Victoria,,The Sports Terraces are a strong match for our current volunteer strengths.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
69,3,2,talk,Shunichi,,"@Minato, ponds are easier than massive structural changes if we follow the natural drainage.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
70,3,3,talk,Minato,,I think the Wetland Restoration is a safe bet for the contractors.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
71,3,3,talk,May,,"I'm torn, but the Sports Terraces seem like a balanced cost for the city.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
72,3,3,talk,Shizue,,I'm voting for the Wetland Restoration. It's the only thing that seems to last.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
73,3,3,talk,Victoria,,I'll stick with the Sports Terraces to utilize our existing volunteer groups.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
74,3,3,talk,Shunichi,,The Wetland Restoration is the only one that addresses the actual environment.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
75,3,4,talk,Minato,,I agree with Shunichi and Shizue. Wetland it is.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[""Shunichi"",""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
76,3,4,talk,May,,I'll go with the Sports Terraces for the budget.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
